sequenceDiagram
    actor Staff as Tenant staff browser
    participant UI as Admin dashboard page
    participant BFF as Next.js admin route handler
    participant API as NestJS tenant API
    participant Auth as Session and permission guards
    participant DB as Tenant database

    Staff->>UI: Open dashboard route
    UI->>BFF: Request dashboard data
    BFF->>BFF: Read session and trusted tenant host
    BFF->>API: Forward request with server-owned context
    API->>Auth: Validate staff session, membership, permission
    Auth-->>API: Authorized tenant principal
    API->>DB: Query tenant-scoped dashboard aggregates
    DB-->>API: Metrics and operational summaries
    API-->>BFF: Sanitized response
    BFF-->>UI: Render data or structured error state
    UI-->>Staff: Dashboard with loading/error/empty states

    Note over BFF,Auth: Browser input must not select a database or bypass authorization.